# No server-side secrets are required to run this template.
#
# The You.com API key is supplied by each visitor in their browser (BYOK).
# It is sent per request through the app's own /api/you proxy route and is
# never stored or logged on the server.
#
# Keyless trial mode needs no secret either: it calls You.com's keyless free
# tier (https://api.you.com/mcp/free). Turn it off with keylessTrial in
# src/lib/app-config.ts.
#
# Webflow Cloud injects these automatically at build time. You only set them
# manually if you want to simulate a mounted path in local dev:
# BASE_URL=/demos/template
# ASSETS_PREFIX=
